  "description": "Stressed out from his job search, Hogyu visits a urology clinic, only to discover that he’s unusually sensitive in a certain spot. Impressed by his “talent,” the doctor offers to introduce him to a special job opportunity. With a mix of nerves and curiosity, Hogyu shows up for the interview, where Kang Wook, the manager of a company specializing in massage devices, makes him an unexpected offer.\n\n*“What? You’re saying I’m the exceptional talent you’ve been searching for?”*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/JMT_masage), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/jmt_masage), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000066031), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11762908)",
